      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329915106050048
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Not used by this polygon type.
    - rid: 552786204080472133
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329915122827264
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The team whose base it is (for Capture the Flag, Rugby and the like).
    - rid: 552786204080472134
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329915122827265
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Its platform's index, which making and removing the platform sets.
    - rid: 552786204080472135
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329915122827266
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The light that entering it turns on.
    - rid: 552786204080472136
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329915122827267
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The light that entering it turns off.
    - rid: 552786204080472137
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329915122827268
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The polygon whose platform entering it activates.
    - rid: 552786204080472138
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329915122827269
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The polygon whose platform entering it deactivates.
    - rid: 552786204080472139
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329915122827270
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The polygon it teleports to (a negative number teleports to another level).
    - rid: 552786204080472140
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329915122827271
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Negative, so it teleports to another level: level {0} (the level is -permutation - 1).'
    - rid: 552786204080472141
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329915122827272
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The level it takes the player to once the level's goals are met.
    - rid: 552786204080472142
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329915122827273
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: There's no light {0}.
    - rid: 552786204080472143
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329915122827274
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: There's no polygon {0}.
    - rid: 552786204080472144
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329915122827275
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Polygon {0} isn't a platform.
    - rid: 552786204080472145
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329915122827276
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: There's no terminal {0}.
    - rid: 552786204080472146
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329915122827277
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: There's no goal object {0}.
    - rid: 552786204080472147
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1335803447492608
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: None
    - rid: 552786204080472148
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1335803460075520
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: '{0} - {1}'
    - rid: 552786204080472166
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1413203095076864
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: random
    - rid: 552786204080472167
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1413203095076865
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: fluorescent
    - rid: 552786204080472171
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1424381435330560
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Team {0}
    - rid: 552786204080472172
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1424381435330561
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Goal Number:'
    - rid: 552786204080472173
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1424381435330562
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The number terminals' checkpoints show this goal's location by.
    - rid: 552786204080472194
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1593782172270592
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Terminal {0} has no #UNFINISHED group, so the game shows nothing when it''s used: a terminal is read from the group after its #UNFINISHED group (or its #SUCCESS or #FAILURE group, which fall back to #UNFINISHED). The fix adds an #UNFINISHED group at its start.'
    - rid: 552786204080472195
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1593782172270593
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Terminal {0}: the game never reaches these groups, so they''re never shown: {1}. A section is read from its start (the first #UNFINISHED, #SUCCESS or #FAILURE group) to its #END or teleport, so move them into a section, or remove them.'
    - rid: 552786204080472196
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1593782172270594
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Terminal {0}: the section before group {1} ({2}) runs on into it, so the game shows a blank page for it, then goes on into its section. The fix adds an #END before it.'
    - rid: 552786204080472197
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1593782172270595
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Terminal {0}: group {1} ({2}) is read as a blank page, since only the first {2} group (group {3}) starts a section. The fix removes it.'
    - rid: 552786204080472198
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1593782172270596
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Terminal {0}: group {1} ({2}) never worked in Marathon or Aleph One: reading it leaves the player in the terminal, where no key goes on or leaves. Change its type, or remove it.'
    - rid: 552786204080472199
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1593782172270597
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Terminal {0}: group {1} (#INTERLEVEL TELEPORT) teleports to level {2}, which the map doesn''t have (it has {3} levels, numbered from 0, and level 256 ends the game). Change its permutation to one of the map''s levels.'
    - rid: 552786204080472200
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1593782172270598
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Terminal {0}: group {1} (#INTRALEVEL TELEPORT) teleports to polygon {2}, which the level doesn''t have. Change its permutation to one of the level''s polygons.'
    - rid: 552786204080472201
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1593782172270599
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Terminal {0}: group {1} (#CHECKPOINT) shows where goal object {2} is, but the level has no goal object numbered {2}. Add one (in Objects mode), or change the group''s permutation.'
    - rid: 552786204080472202
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1593782172270600
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Side {0} is a terminal's control panel, but it uses terminal {1}, which the level doesn't have (it has {2} terminals, numbered from 0). Change its permutation (in Geometry mode) to one of the level's terminals.
    - rid: 552786204080472207
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1630401067630592
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: '{0} ({1})'
    - rid: 552786204080472208
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1630401084407808
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: None
    - rid: 552786204080472209
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1630401084407809
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: '{0} bytes'
    - rid: 552786204080472210
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1630401084407810
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: "{0}\n\n(\u2026 and {1} more characters)"
    - rid: 552786204080472211
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1630401084407811
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: There's no level {0}.
    - rid: 552786204080472241
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1786210242150400
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Heights
    - rid: 552786240694648884
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1916131484516352
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: '{0}/1024'
    - rid: 552786240694648885
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1916131501293568
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: '{0} and {1}/1024'
    - rid: 552786240694648886
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1916131501293569
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Position X:'
    - rid: 552786240694648887
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1916131501293570
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Position Y:'
    - rid: 552786240694648888
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1916131501293571
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Vertical Distance:'
    - rid: 552786240694648889
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879872
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Its index in the level's objects
    - rid: 552786240694648890
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879873
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Whether it's a monster, item, scenery, player start, goal or sound source. Choosing another starts its subtype at the type's first.
    - rid: 552786240694648891
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879874
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: What kind of monster, item or scenery it is, or a player start's team
    - rid: 552786240694648892
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879875
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: What it goes for once it's activated
    - rid: 552786240694648893
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879876
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The way it faces, in degrees
    - rid: 552786240694648894
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879877
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The light whose intensity its volume follows while the game runs (light 0 can't be one)
    - rid: 552786240694648895
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879878
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Its volume as it''s saved: the light''s index, negated'
    - rid: 552786240694648896
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879879
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Where it is across the level (moving it moves it to the polygon it's then in)
    - rid: 552786240694648897
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879880
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Where it is down the level (moving it moves it to the polygon it's then in)
    - rid: 552786240694648898
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879881
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: How far above its polygon's floor it is (or below its ceiling, when From Ceiling is enabled)
    - rid: 552786240694648899
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879882
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: A monster teleports in when it's activated, rather than being there from the start
    - rid: 552786240694648900
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879883
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: It hangs from its polygon's ceiling, and its height is measured down from it
    - rid: 552786240694648901
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879884
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The monster can't see what would activate it
    - rid: 552786240694648902
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879885
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The monster can't hear what would activate it
    - rid: 552786240694648903
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879886
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: An item only placed in network (multiplayer) games
    - rid: 552786240694648904
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879887
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The game uses it for the sound sources media make as the level runs
    - rid: 552786240694648905
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879888
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The polygon it's in
    - rid: 552786240694648906
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879889
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The line it's on. It's drawn (its polygons' heights expose it), but the level has no side for it, so it has no texture or light.
    - rid: 552786240694648907
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879890
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Which face of the line it is
    - rid: 552786240694648908
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879891
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The polygon it faces
    - rid: 552786240694648909
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879892
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The polygon on the line's other side
    - rid: 552786240694648910
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879893
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Its index in the level's polygons
    - rid: 552786240694648911
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879894
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: What it does in the game. Choosing Platform makes it a platform (with a S'pht door's settings), and choosing another type for a platform removes its platform.
    - rid: 552786240694648912
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879895
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: What it means depends on the type (such as the light or platform a trigger switches). A platform's is its platform's index.
    - rid: 552786240694648913
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879896
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Its floor's height, which can't pass its ceiling (a platform's is set by its platform)
    - rid: 552786240694648914
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879897
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The light its floor is lit by (a landscape doesn't use one)
    - rid: 552786240694648915
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879898
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Its ceiling's height, which can't pass its floor (a platform's is set by its platform)
    - rid: 552786240694648916
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879899
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The light its ceiling is lit by (a landscape doesn't use one)
    - rid: 552786240694648917
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879900
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The media (liquid) in it, which Media mode paints
    - rid: 552786240694648918
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879901
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The light its media's surface is lit by (only a polygon with media uses it)
    - rid: 552786240694648919
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879902
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The sound source plays its platform's moving sound instead of its own, while the platform moves
