        m_Value: Level
    - rid: 552786240694648952
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151331820879935
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Map
    - rid: 552786269510828085
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2506128390504448
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Display Options
    - rid: 552786269510828086
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2506192999563264
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: What the level view shows. Every option is listed; those the current mode decides are grayed out (and shown on where the mode always shows them).
    - rid: 552786279223525425
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2532770391408640
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Snaps what you drag to even steps: positions and heights to sixteenths of a world unit, and angles, volumes and other numbers to steps of 5 (pitch to 0.05). Hold alt/option to invert it.'
    - rid: 552786288315990091
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799310348288
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Polygon {0} is inside out: its corners go counterclockwise, so the engine can''t tell what''s inside it. Move its points back so they go clockwise.'
    - rid: 552786288315990092
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736896
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Polygon {0} inside out
    - rid: 552786288315990093
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736897
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Polygon {0} has no area: its corners are all in a line. Move one of its points out of line with the others.'
    - rid: 552786288315990094
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736898
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Polygon {0} without area
    - rid: 552786288315990095
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736899
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Polygon {0} is concave at point {1}. Polygons must be convex, or the engine draws them and collides with them wrongly (and can put things in the wrong polygon). Move the point (or its neighbors) so the corner bends outward.
    - rid: 552786288315990096
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736900
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Polygon {0} concave at point {1}
    - rid: 552786288315990097
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736901
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Polygon {0}'s lines {1} and {2} cross each other. Move its points so its edges don't cross.
    - rid: 552786288315990098
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736902
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Polygon {0}'s lines {1} and {2} crossing
    - rid: 552786288315990099
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736903
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Line {0} has no length: its points ({1} and {2}) are in the same place. Fixing collapses them into one point, without the line (polygons along it lose that corner).'
    - rid: 552786288315990100
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736904
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Line {0} without length
    - rid: 552786288315990101
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736905
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'It can''t be collapsed for you, since a polygon has both points without the line between them: move one of its points.'
    - rid: 552786288315990102
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736906
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Line {0} is longer than 32 world units (32,767 units), the farthest a distance can be: Marathon 2''s and Infinity''s distances wrap around past that, and Aleph One''s stop there, so it''s measured wrong. Move its points closer together.'
    - rid: 552786288315990103
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736907
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Line {0} too long
    - rid: 552786288315990104
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736908
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The level needs {0} map indexes (what's near each polygon, and the sound sources each hears), more than even Aleph One allows (65,534). Fewer, larger polygons need fewer.
    - rid: 552786288315990105
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736909
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Aleph One only: the level needs {0} map indexes (what''s near each polygon, and the sound sources each hears), more than Marathon 2 and Infinity allow (32,767). Fewer, larger polygons need fewer.'
    - rid: 552786288315990106
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736910
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Point {1} is in the middle of a straight edge of polygon {0}, and nothing else meets it (its lines have the same sides and neighbors), so it could be removed without changing anything.
    - rid: 552786288315990107
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736911
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Point {1} a redundant straight corner
    - rid: 552786288315990108
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736912
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Point {0} is less than 1/64 of a world unit from line {1} (of polygon {2}) without being on it, which leaves a sliver of a gap: move it onto the line, or away from it.'
    - rid: 552786288315990109
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736913
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Point {0} almost on line {1}
    - rid: 552786288315990110
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736914
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Object {0} is outside every polygon. Fixing puts it back inside its polygon ({1}), at the nearest place inside its edge.
    - rid: 552786288315990111
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736915
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Annotation {0} isn't in its polygon ({1}). Fixing gives it the polygon it's in, or else puts it back inside its polygon's edge.
    - rid: 552786288315990112
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736916
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Can't move there ({0}). Hold Shift to allow it.
    - rid: 552786288315990113
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724799318736917
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: ', +{0} more'
